{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>For there will be no end</b> — and no future for the wicked. The meaning: no son or grandson will remain to him after his death." "<b>Lamp</b> — that their soul will die before its end."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:30.839764866Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}